1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:06,010
Good,now I was also thinking about some different materials that we haven't got in there at all.
很好。我还想到了一些我们这里没有的各种资源。

2
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:11,180
What do you think of the idea of introducing some workbooks?
你觉得引进一些练习册怎么样？

3
00:00:11,190 --> 00:00:16,420
If we break them up into separate pages and laminate them, they'd be a great resource.
如果我们将它们拆分成单页，它们将是很好的资源。

4
00:00:16,430 --> 00:00:24,430
The students could study the main course book in class and then do follow-up practice in the Self-Access Centre. That sounds good.
学生们可以在课堂上学习主要的教材知识，然后在自习室做后续的练习。听起来不错。

5
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:29,500
Okay,now finally we need to think about how the room is used.
好的，最后我们要想想怎么使用空间。

6
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:37,470
I'll have to talk to the teachers and make sure we can all reach some agreement on a timetable to supervise the centre after class.
我得跟老师们谈谈，确保在课后监督中心的时间上达成一致。

7
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:43,710
But we also need to think about security,too.Especially if we're going to invest in some new equipment.
但是我们也要考虑安全问题。特别是当我们对一些新设备投资时。

8
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:46,220
What about putting in an alarm?
装警报器怎么样？

9
00:00:46,230 --> 00:00:51,360
Good idea.The other thing I'd like to do is talk to our technicians and see whether we could somehow limit the access to email.
好主意。我要做的另一件事是找到技术人员，看看能否减少电邮的使用。

10
00:00:51,370 --> 00:00:58,370
I really don't want to see that resource misused.
我不想看到资源被滥用。

11
00:00:58,380 --> 00:01:02,810
What about if we agree to only use it before and after class?
如果我们同意只在课前或课后用怎么样？

12
00:01:02,820 --> 00:01:07,430
Yes,that would be fine.OK,anyway...that's great for now.
好的，没问题。好的，总之目前还不错。

13
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:11,030
We'll discuss it further when we've managed to...
我们将进一步讨论，当……
